# Fixture-owned ignore rules for the file-index autotest (FIC-42..44).
#
# The patterns below are deliberately distinctive so the assertions test THIS
# file rather than accidentally passing because the enclosing repository's root
# .gitignore happens to cover the same path. Do not replace them with common
# patterns like `dist/` or `*.log` — the repo root already ignores several of
# those, which would make the test pass even if .gitignore support regressed.
onward-gitignored-dir/
*.onward-gitignored

# Negation must survive too: git lets a later `!` rule re-include a path, and a
# hand-rolled matcher is most likely to get exactly this wrong.
!keep-me.onward-gitignored
